#: ../../source/users/folio/delete_folio.rst:5
msgid "Delete Folio"
msgstr "删除图幅"

#: ../../source/users/folio/delete_folio.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows deleting `folios`_ from a `project`_ from `menu bar`_ "
"and `projects panel`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 和 `项目面板 <projects panel_>`_ 删除 `项目 "
"<project_>`_ 中的 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/delete_folio.rst:10
msgid "Delete folio from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏删除图幅"

#: ../../source/users/folio/delete_folio.rst:12
msgid ""
"Select **Project > Delete this folio** menu item to delete the active "
"`folio`_."
msgstr "选择 **Project > Delete this folio** 菜单项以删除当前 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/delete_folio.rst:17
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Project menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目菜单"

#: ../../source/users/folio/delete_folio.rst:20
msgid "Delete folio from projects panel"
msgstr "从项目面板删除图幅"

#: ../../source/users/folio/delete_folio.rst:22
msgid "Right click on the `folio`_ which should be deleted."
msgstr "右键单击要删除的 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/delete_folio.rst:23
msgid ""
"Click the option **Delete this folio** to delete the selected `folio`_."
msgstr "单击选项 **Delete this folio** 以删除选中的 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/delete_folio.rst:28
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Project panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目面板"

#: ../../source/users/folio/delete_folio.rst:32
msgid ""
"If the `projects panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Projects**"
msgstr ""
"如果 `项目面板 <projects panel_>`_ 未显示，可从 **Settings > Display > Projects** 中将其显示。"
